<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#181c21" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">
  <meta name="description" content="Aberration turns streaming sensor data into evidence of change. Continuous anomaly detection for connected systems.">
  <title>Aberration — Evidence of change.</title>
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://{{ ingress_base_domain | e }}/">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2064%2064%22%20width%3D%2264%22%20height%3D%2264%22%20role%3D%22img%22%3E%0A%20%20%3Ctitle%3EAberration%3C%2Ftitle%3E%0A%20%20%3Cstyle%3E%3Aroot%7Bcolor%3A%23000%7D%40media%28prefers-color-scheme%3Adark%29%7B%3Aroot%7Bcolor%3A%23fff%7D%7D%3C%2Fstyle%3E%0A%20%20%3Cpath%20id%3D%22mark%22%20fill%3D%22currentColor%22%20d%3D%22M10%2010H38V20H20V54H10ZM44%2010H54V54H26V44H44Z%22%2F%3E%0A%3C%2Fsvg%3E%0A">
  <style>
    /* Mirror the application tokens in frontend/src/App.css. Keep this page self-contained:
       the landing CSP allows inline styles and data: images only, so no scripts or web fonts. */
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --background: 0 0% 100%;
      --foreground: 210 22% 19%;
      --primary: 170 37% 36%;
      --primary-foreground: 0 0% 100%;
      --muted: 220 23% 97%;
      --muted-foreground: 210 10% 44%;
      --accent: 210 21% 95%;
      --border: 210 15% 92%;
      --radius: .5rem;
      --mono: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", SFMono-Regular, "JetBrains Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      background: hsl(var(--background));
      color: hsl(var(--foreground));
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark;
        --background: 213 16% 11%;
        --foreground: 207 22% 90%;
        --primary: 164 28% 64%;
        --primary-foreground: 213 16% 11%;
        --muted: 213 19% 9%;
        --muted-foreground: 207 11% 63%;
        --accent: 212 18% 16%;
        --border: 212 13% 19%;
      }
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { min-width: 320px; margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid hsl(var(--primary)); outline-offset: 5px; }
    ::selection { background: hsl(var(--primary)); color: hsl(var(--primary-foreground)); }
    .skip-link { position: absolute; top: 12px; left: 24px; z-index: 5; padding: 12px 16px; border: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); border-radius: var(--radius); background: hsl(var(--background)); transform: translateY(-160%); }
    .skip-link:focus { transform: translateY(0); }
    .brand-mark { display: block; width: 28px; height: 28px; flex-shrink: 0; color: #000; }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { .brand-mark { color: #fff; } }
    .wordmark { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-height: 44px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .arrow { width: 16px; height: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.6; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; transition: transform .2s ease; }
    a:hover > .arrow { transform: translateX(2px); }
    .mono { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    /* Footer and legal panels */
    .site-footer { border-top: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); }
    .footer-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 24px; padding-block: 16px; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .04em; }
    .footer-brand { margin: 0; color: hsl(var(--foreground)); }
    .footer-links { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 24px; }
    .footer-links a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; }
    .footer-links a:hover, .legal-close:hover { color: hsl(var(--primary)); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
    .legal-panel { display: none; padding-block: 32px 40px; border-top: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); overflow-wrap: anywhere; scroll-margin-top: 24px; }
    .legal-panel:target { display: block; }
    .legal-heading { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; max-width: 760px; }
    .legal-heading h2 { font-size: 23px; }
    .legal-close { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: 12px; }
    .legal-template { max-width: 760px; margin: 12px 0 24px; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: 13px; }
    .legal-details { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(140px, 1fr) 3fr; gap: 16px 32px; max-width: 760px; margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .legal-details dt { font-weight: 500; }
    .legal-details dd { min-width: 0; margin: 0; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); }
    .legal-panel:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid hsl(var(--primary)); outline-offset: 4px; }
    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .footer-inner { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; padding-block: 20px; }
      .legal-details { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }
      .legal-details dd + dt { margin-top: 16px; }
    }
    .container { width: min(100% - 96px, 1280px); margin-inline: auto; }
    .site-header { border-bottom: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); }
    .header-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 24px; min-height: 64px; }
    .header-meta { color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); }
    .header-nav { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 20px; }
    .header-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; min-height: 44px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; }
    .header-link:hover { color: hsl(var(--primary)); }
    .hero { padding-block: 88px 0; }
    .kicker { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; margin: 0 0 40px; padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid hsl(var(--foreground)); color: hsl(var(--foreground)); }
    .kicker span:last-child { color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); }
    h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(64px, 11.2vw, 168px); line-height: .9; letter-spacing: -.065em; font-weight: 450; }
    h1 em { font-style: normal; color: hsl(var(--primary)); }
    .hero-sub { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 48px; align-items: end; margin-top: 48px; }
    .description { max-width: 480px; margin: 0; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px 20px; }
    .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; min-height: 48px; padding: 12px 20px; border: 1px solid hsl(var(--foreground)); border-radius: 0; background: hsl(var(--foreground)); color: hsl(var(--background)); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; transition: background .2s ease, border-color .2s ease; }
    .button:hover { border-color: hsl(var(--primary)); background: hsl(var(--primary)); color: hsl(var(--primary-foreground)); }
    .button-ghost { background: transparent; color: hsl(var(--foreground)); }
    .text-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 44px; font-size: 13px; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); }
    .text-link:hover { color: hsl(var(--foreground)); }
    .figure { margin: 88px 0 0; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); }
    .figure-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); }
    .figure-head b { color: hsl(var(--primary)); font-weight: 500; }
    .trace-art { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; margin-top: 16px; overflow: visible; }
    .trace-art text { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .06em; fill: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); }
    .band { fill: hsl(var(--foreground) / .05); }
    .axis { stroke: hsl(var(--border)); stroke-width: 1; }
    .ticks line { stroke: hsl(var(--muted-foreground) / .6); stroke-width: 1; }
    .trace { fill: none; stroke: hsl(var(--foreground)); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-linejoin: round; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; }
    .trace-after { stroke: hsl(var(--primary)); stroke-width: 2; }
    .reveal { animation: reveal 2.4s cubic-bezier(.4, 0, .2, 1) both; }
    @keyframes reveal { from { clip-path: inset(0 100% 0 0); } to { clip-path: inset(0 0 0 0); } }
    .out { fill: hsl(var(--primary)); }
    .cp { stroke: hsl(var(--primary)); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 5; }
    .trace-art .cp-label { fill: hsl(var(--primary)); }
    .cursor { fill: hsl(var(--primary)); animation: blink 1.2s steps(2, start) infinite; }
    @keyframes blink { to { visibility: hidden; } }
    .caption { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 120px minmax(0, 560px); gap: 24px; margin-top: 20px; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 24px; margin: 96px 0 0; padding-block: 24px; border-block: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); }
    .facts dt { color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); }
    .facts dd { margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .approach { padding-block: 120px 104px; scroll-margin-top: 24px; }
    .section-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 120px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 56px; }
    .section-heading .mono { padding-top: 14px; color: hsl(var(--primary)); }
    h2 { margin: 0; max-width: 820px; font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 54px); line-height: 1.02; font-weight: 450; letter-spacing: -.055em; }
    h2 span { color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); }
    .rows { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; border-top: 1px solid hsl(var(--foreground)); }
    .row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 120px 160px minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr); gap: 24px; align-items: baseline; padding-block: 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid hsl(var(--border)); transition: background .2s ease; }
    .row:hover { background: linear-gradient(90deg, hsl(var(--primary) / .06), transparent 70%); }
    .row-index { color: hsl(var(--primary)); }
    .row-label { color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); }
    h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 450; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
    .row p { max-width: 460px; margin: 0; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; }
    .closing { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 120px minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 24px; align-items: end; padding-block: 0 120px; }
    .closing .mono { color: hsl(var(--primary)); padding-bottom: 12px; }
    .closing p { margin: 16px 0 0; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); font-size: 16px; }
    @media (max-width: 1050px) {
      .container { width: calc(100% - 56px); }
      .header-meta { display: none; }
      .header-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; }
      .hero-sub { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
      .facts { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
      .row { grid-template-columns: 80px minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.4fr); }
      .row-label { display: none; }
      .section-heading, .caption { grid-template-columns: 80px minmax(0, 1fr); }
      .closing { grid-template-columns: 80px minmax(0, 1fr); }
      .closing .button { grid-column: 2; justify-self: start; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .container { width: calc(100% - 32px); }
      .header-inner { min-height: 60px; gap: 8px; }
      .header-nav { gap: 12px; }
      .hero { padding-top: 48px; }
      .kicker { margin-bottom: 28px; }
      .kicker span:last-child { display: none; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(52px, 17vw, 88px); }
      .description { font-size: 16px; }
      .figure { margin-top: 56px; }
      .figure-head span:last-child { display: none; }
      .trace-art { width: 180%; max-width: none; margin-left: -80%; }
      .figure { overflow: hidden; }
      .caption, .section-heading { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; }
      .facts { margin-top: 56px; }
      .approach { padding-block: 80px 64px; }
      .row { grid-template-columns: 48px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 8px 16px; padding-block: 24px; }
      .row p { grid-column: 2; }
      .closing { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-bottom: 80px; }
      .closing .button { grid-column: 1; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 380px) {
      .wordmark { gap: 7px; font-size: 14px; }
      .header-link { gap: 4px; font-size: 12px; }
      .facts { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }
    }
    @media (forced-colors: active) {
      .brand-mark { color: LinkText; }
      .button { border: 1px solid ButtonText; }
      .trace { stroke: CanvasText; }
      .trace-after, .cp { stroke: LinkText; }
      .out, .cursor { fill: LinkText; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <a class="wordmark" href="{{ frontend_base_url | e }}/" aria-label="Aberration home" title="Dashboard home">
        <svg class="brand-mark" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M10 10H38V20H20V54H10ZM44 10H54V54H26V44H44Z"/></svg>
        <span>aberration</span>
      </a>
      <span class="header-meta mono" aria-hidden="true">Evidence of change</span>
      <nav class="header-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
{% if demo_base_url | default('') %}
        <a class="header-link" href="{{ demo_base_url | e }}/">Demo<svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10"/></svg></a>
{% endif %}
        <a class="header-link" href="{{ frontend_base_url | e }}/">Dashboard<svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10"/></svg></a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="container hero" aria-labelledby="headline">
      <p class="kicker mono"><span>Continuous anomaly detection</span><span>For connected systems</span></p>
      <h1 id="headline">Evidence<br>of <em>change.</em></h1>
      <div class="hero-sub">
        <p class="description">Every system has a rhythm. Aberration follows the relationships in your sensor data and brings the moments of change into view.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button" href="{{ frontend_base_url | e }}/">Open dashboard<svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
{% if demo_base_url | default('') %}
          <a class="button button-ghost" href="{{ demo_base_url | e }}/">Live demo<svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10"/></svg></a>
{% endif %}
          <a class="text-link" href="#approach">How it works<svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14m-6-6 6 6 6-6"/></svg></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="figure">
        <div class="figure-head mono" aria-hidden="true"><span>Fig. 01 — <b>stream / vibration</b></span><span>calibrated band · 95%</span></div>
