    <section class="container approach" id="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-heading">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <span class="mono">How it works</span>
        <h2 id="approach-heading">See the change in context. <span>From connected sensor streams to evidence you can explore.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <ol class="rows">
        <li class="row">
          <span class="row-index mono">01</span>
          <span class="row-label mono">Observe</span>
          <h3>Read the relationships.</h3>
          <p>Bring your sensor streams together. See how measurements behave in relation to one another, beyond individual readings.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="row">
          <span class="row-index mono">02</span>
          <span class="row-label mono">Calibrate</span>
          <h3>Establish the reference.</h3>
          <p>Learn from baseline data and calibrate anomaly scores with conformal methods. Give new observations a meaningful reference.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="row">
          <span class="row-index mono">03</span>
          <span class="row-label mono">Detect</span>
          <h3>Follow the evidence.</h3>
          <p>Accumulate evidence as observations arrive. Explore detected changes alongside the telemetry that explains them.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>
